New announcement from variational_lvs in Discord:

@here Expecting some brief downtime for the next hour as we undertake another release for Omni ahead of mainnet soft launch for new features. 

_Note: historical/existing trades and positions on both testnets will be lost/reset._

New announcement from variational_lvs in Discord:

@here Maintenance window starting now for a release! Stay tuned for updates in this channel.

Note: this release will require clearing all account/trading data on testnet. You will be required to relink your wallets and create fresh accounts. As usual, we've snapshotted your past activity, so your contributions to testnet will be safe.

New announcement from mr_plumpkin in Discord:

@here we are doing a small maintenance window.

Note: this release will require clearing all account/trading data ahead of the upcoming trading competition. You will be required to relink your wallets and create fresh accounts.

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

@here maintenance flag going up briefly while we clear open positions for the start of trading competition! 

(all testnet data has been saved internally)

New announcement from variational_lvs in Discord:

@here We are aware of the congestion/performance issues on testnet--specifically around certain users running into delays when linking new wallets. 
These issues will be resolved in mainnet but this week we will perform some upgrades to help address them. We're seeing 20x higher load this competition than last. Keep testing! 🚀

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

Another batch of users have been whitelisted to the Omni beta. This batch is our largest yet, amounting to ~5,000 users. If you joined the waitlist, check your email to see if you got access! 

@here

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

Live on Twitter with friends to chat about DeFi and Variational! Come hang with us: https://x.com/i/spaces/1LyGBWZBnzkJN

@here

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

The top 50 traders by PnL and by volume have each been sent 3 refcode uses! If you're still looking for a refcode to onboard, keep an eye on <#1362491164921434424>. 

@here

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

Small community PSA: Due to some of the Discord changes we made today, if you had the <@&1403098574530547802>, <@&1403099750869499924>, or <@&1403099551560372335> role, you will need to re-claim it in <#1220460341608190015> by clicking the appropriate emojis to regain access to those language channels. 

@here

New announcement from variational_lvs in Discord:

@everyone the temporary disabling of trading was handled in a few minutes by the dev team and we are keeping an active eye on platform metrics. If you were adversely affected, please open a <#1332419182473642107> ticket and we will address a fair resolution on a case-by-case basis.

We take even a few minutes of trading interruption very seriously and will share a postmortem shortly about the risk limit that was hit and how it will be changed to avoid issues in the future.

New announcement from 0xmgb in Discord:

For week 6 of the Omni points program, 150,000 points were distributed across 31,238 accounts.

@here
